{"unit_id":"tag:025N:proof","translation":"若<MATH_0001>正则（regular），则<MATH_0002>正则（regular），由《代数（Algebra）》中的引理<REF_0001>可知。\n假设<MATH_0003>正则（regular）。设<MATH_0004>是<MATH_0005>的极大（maximal）理想（ideal）。则<MATH_0006>（见引理<REF_0002>）。\n另一方面，<MATH_0007>是<MATH_0008>的极大（maximal）理想（ideal），故<MATH_0009>由至多<MATH_0010>个元素（elements）生成（generated）。因此<MATH_0011>正则（regular）。\n（也可使用稍一般一些的《代数（Algebra）》中的引理<REF_0003>。）\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"regular","target_term":"正则"},{"source_term":"regular","target_term":"正则"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"regular","target_term":"正则"},{"source_term":"maximal","target_term":"极大"},{"source_term":"ideal","target_term":"理想"},{"source_term":"maximal","target_term":"极大"},{"source_term":"ideal","target_term":"理想"},{"source_term":"elements","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"generated","target_term":"生成"},{"source_term":"regular","target_term":"正则"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"regular","target_term":"正则","context":"环的正则性；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数","context":"引用章名；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"maximal","target_term":"极大","context":"局部环的唯一极大理想；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"ideal","target_term":"理想","context":"维数与生成元论证中的理想；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"elements","target_term":"元素","context":"生成元数量；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"generated","target_term":"生成","context":"理想商的生成性质；译名待决。"}],"notes":["源文受保护公式写作mathfrak m_B/mathfrak m_B，分母未带平方；原字节保留，不自行修公式。"]}
{"unit_id":"tag:025O:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>、<MATH_0002>是诺特局部环（Noetherian local rings）。\n设<MATH_0003>是平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）的局部环（local rings）同态（homomorphism）。\n则<MATH_0004>约化（reduced）当且仅当<MATH_0005>亦然。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Noetherian local rings","target_term":"诺特局部环"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"local rings","target_term":"局部环"},{"source_term":"homomorphism","target_term":"同态"},{"source_term":"reduced","target_term":"约化"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Noetherian local rings","target_term":"诺特局部环","context":"给定的两个环；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"同态性质；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"local rings","target_term":"局部环","context":"同态的源与靶；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"homomorphism","target_term":"同态","context":"给定映射；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"reduced","target_term":"约化","context":"所保持的环性质；译名待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:025O:proof","translation":"由<MATH_0001>的忠实（faithful）平坦性（flatness）可清楚看出，若<MATH_0002>约化（reduced），则<MATH_0003>亦然。另见《代数（Algebra）》中的引理<REF_0001>。\n反之，假设<MATH_0004>约化（reduced）。由假设，<MATH_0005>是一个局部化（localization）：将某个有限型（finite type）<MATH_0006>-代数（algebra）<MATH_0007>在某个素理想（prime）<MATH_0008>处局部化。\n将<MATH_0009>替换为一个局部化（localization）后，可假设<MATH_0010>平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）于<MATH_0011>之上，见引理<REF_0002>。\n于是可知《代数（Algebra）》中的引理<REF_0003>适用于<MATH_0012>，从而<MATH_0013>约化（reduced）。因此<MATH_0014>约化（reduced）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"faithful","target_term":"忠实"},{"source_term":"flatness","target_term":"平坦性"},{"source_term":"reduced","target_term":"约化"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"reduced","target_term":"约化"},{"source_term":"localization","target_term":"局部化"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型"},{"source_term":"algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"prime","target_term":"素理想"},{"source_term":"localization","target_term":"局部化"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"reduced","target_term":"约化"},{"source_term":"reduced","target_term":"约化"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"faithful","target_term":"忠实","context":"忠实平坦性的限定；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"flatness","target_term":"平坦性","context":"下降约化性所用性质；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"reduced","target_term":"约化","context":"环的约化性；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数","context":"引用章名；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"localization","target_term":"局部化","context":"将局部环表示为有限型代数的局部化；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型","context":"代数的有限性；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"algebra","target_term":"代数","context":"所用有限型代数；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"prime","target_term":"素理想","context":"局部化所用素理想；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"缩小后的代数结构；译名待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:039U:statement","translation":"关于“约化性（reducedness）”的结果，在平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）局部环（local ring）映射（maps）<MATH_0001>的较弱定义下并不成立：在这种定义中，去掉了<MATH_0002>在<MATH_0003>之上本质有限型（essentially of finite type）的假设。\n也就是说，可能存在一个诺特局部整环（Noetherian local domain）<MATH_0004>，其完备化（completion）<MATH_0005>非约化（nonreduced），见《例》的第<REF_0001>节。\n但环映射（ring map）<MATH_0006>是平坦的（flat），且<MATH_0007>是<MATH_0008>的极大（maximal）理想（ideal）；当然，<MATH_0009>和<MATH_0010>具有相同的剩余域（residue fields）。因此，重要的是只对本质有限型（essentially of finite type）的环（ring）扩张（extensions）考虑这一概念（或者，当<MATH_0011>不是诺特的（Noetherian）时，对本质上为有限表示（finite presentation）的环扩张考虑）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"reducedness","target_term":"约化性"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"local ring","target_term":"局部环"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"essentially of finite type","target_term":"本质有限型"},{"source_term":"Noetherian local domain","target_term":"诺特局部整环"},{"source_term":"completion","target_term":"完备化"},{"source_term":"nonreduced","target_term":"非约化"},{"source_term":"ring map","target_term":"环映射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦的"},{"source_term":"maximal","target_term":"极大"},{"source_term":"ideal","target_term":"理想"},{"source_term":"residue fields","target_term":"剩余域"},{"source_term":"essentially of finite type","target_term":"本质有限型"},{"source_term":"ring","target_term":"环"},{"source_term":"extensions","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"Noetherian","target_term":"诺特的"},{"source_term":"finite presentation","target_term":"有限表示"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"reducedness","target_term":"约化性","context":"前一命题讨论的性质；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"此注记讨论定义的有限性要求；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"local ring","target_term":"局部环","context":"映射对象；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"所讨论局部环映射；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"essentially of finite type","target_term":"本质有限型","context":"不能省略的有限性假设；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"Noetherian local 