{"unit_id":"tag:025P:proof","translation":"正规性（normality）的下降见《代数（Algebra）》中的引理<REF_0001>。反之，假设<MATH_0001>正规（normal）。\n由假设，<MATH_0002>是一个局部化（localization）：将某个有限型（finite type）<MATH_0003>-代数（algebra）<MATH_0004>在某个素理想（prime）<MATH_0005>处局部化。将<MATH_0006>替换为一个局部化（localization）后，可假设<MATH_0007>平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）于<MATH_0008>之上，见引理<REF_0002>。\n于是可知《代数（Algebra）》中的引理<REF_0003>适用于<MATH_0009>，从而断定<MATH_0010>正规（normal）。\n因此<MATH_0011>是正规（normal）整环（domain）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"normality","target_term":"正规性"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"normal","target_term":"正规"},{"source_term":"localization","target_term":"局部化"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型"},{"source_term":"algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"prime","target_term":"素理想"},{"source_term":"localization","target_term":"局部化"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"normal","target_term":"正规"},{"source_term":"normal","target_term":"正规"},{"source_term":"domain","target_term":"整环"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"normality","target_term":"正规性","context":"首先引用的下降性质；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数","context":"引用章名；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"normal","target_term":"正规","context":"所研究环的性质；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"localization","target_term":"局部化","context":"将局部环表示为有限型代数的局部化；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型","context":"代数的有限性；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"algebra","target_term":"代数","context":"用于局部表示的代数；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"prime","target_term":"素理想","context":"局部化所用素理想；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"缩小后的代数结构；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"domain","target_term":"整环","context":"结论中的无零因子条件；译名待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:025L:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n前面的命题在一定程度上说明，为何我们希望将平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）映射（maps）看作“局部同构（isomorphisms）”。另一个很好地表明我们找到了“正确”定义的性质是：对于有限型（finite type）的<MATH_0001>-概形（schemes），一个态射（morphism）平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）当且仅当其对应的解析空间（analytic spaces）上的态射（morphism）（给<MATH_0002>-值点（points）赋予复（complex）拓扑（topology））是解析意义下的局部同构（isomorphism）（在源上局部为开嵌入（open embedding））。\n借助结构定理（structure theorem），以及解析化（analytification）与完备化的（completed）局部环（local rings）的构造交换（commutes）这一事实，可以证明此事——细节留给读者。\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"analytic spaces","target_term":"解析空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"open embedding","target_term":"开嵌入"},{"source_term":"structure theorem","target_term":"结构定理"},{"source_term":"analytification","target_term":"解析化"},{"source_term":"completed","target_term":"完备化的"},{"source_term":"local rings","target_term":"局部环"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"本章态射性质；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"局部同构类比中的映射；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构","context":"原文局部同构的复数形式；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型","context":"复概形的有限性；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"复数域上的概形；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"代数态射及其解析化；译名待决。"},{"source_term":"analytic spaces","target_term":"解析空间","context":"复点